      "uid": "zhcn:38b92e2c6b6ae68a1fda8f17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦想着参加令人“闪闪发亮”\n又“兴奋不已”的比赛，\n她展开了迈向闪耀系列赛的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30dc99ef1812d2fff324e83350892c6c99ee9c3ed0fdbd82c6460c2a8a83b348",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5ef7204a71d7e0b8e9c788",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员下定了决心，\n要让她成长为出色的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5840b60cd8c670c037454ad9498c202b2469f9384f97280b2f7b319ec7c3427b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805ede6286a2c2aa4ab32908",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "726c929fdaa613b5165f702e8db3fee6a3c5cd61b42b4e4424f0b7a346e84381",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b9a524e3eb6c8b7e9a4a61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了即将到来的出道战，\n摩耶重炮进行了各式各样的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5a41d0302db472192e8ec03e8aadf20cffb8de5ca45666add73893df86b3e68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94386cb602d708e40904c1e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天赋异禀的她，\n凭借着敏锐的直觉而接二连三地\n精通了许多新战术和动作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3829a45c6f0ffb9277b938d55859c1fc96a806c5dc0e42670739ff26545e31c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3207c00c106664244f0ef362",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而训练员……\n则为了满足她的要求绞尽了脑汁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07728f170a004cfe9e6d5061559d9025f876b85b7a65073b1b538b780e3fac0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac501512338f93711e7991d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想闪闪发亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "859cc14c1c45086d951ba963ba76ad1b531323808cdaee87cb1ec1dbb5a63c53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb859a64d05259b73d932c6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“出道战”结束后过了几个月，\n训练员因为担心情绪低落的摩耶重炮，\n所以带她去了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b3fbaaa8702a6c131861ae44c9c82cdd09eeae9309c9aa1eb9adcaa1b38c761",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f312144b59696533c694656",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了赛场之后，摩耶重炮向训练员坦白，\n认为比赛跟她理想中的相差甚远，\n让她感到非常地“无聊”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ccde881f84f20acce9a7e784e113d4476de21112db459bb14745c79c502ca02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95cd18724588a2db5254616b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员为了消除她的不满，\n决定让她挑战能发挥其才能的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78260fa084de1817bb0f49b7f8ae539e2ba457bfc42ac8215e26955d1a78a5ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dca99231a631784edb4bf3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来约会吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "01cd825e0e6708b9c730c23e4ffc2fb3f273cc2501a622a765f74c7d9a6273e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d574c94104d859bff67926d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春天……经典赛的季节到来。\n训练员思索着究竟该如何\n规划她今后的参赛计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "311982fc27f2c709ba52b8156900b2d3f72623741d0695ea55d1a80d22b12366",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2021da5fea87d99e393a0900",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在此时，两人偶然看见\n记录了“三冠赛马娘”成田白仁\n比赛时的视频。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beee5a1868d88c53d18bd2d0981428cd22ba926ef51abac86077f808995fbc79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37b8ff8db9a99f43372c158",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员在看了成田白仁的表现后，\n认为要是摩耶重炮也有像她一样的劲敌就好了，\n并对此感到可惜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eba6c5edf26a2d355d09264a864fcf7d4ff4d7c67c35edec79b1c506581157d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ff2d972a088cd415a71560",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后摩耶重炮对于训练员仍持续看着\n成田白仁的视频一事心生嫉妒，\n而对着训练员喊话希望他能只看着自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d320ba57342f69e2a387d8876decf5e14509d994b06c4deceb149f0696106d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8c2aa22dfee3a74e77f039",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而摩耶重炮为了独占训练员的视线，\n认真地订下了要超越成田白仁的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3f6267be9fac3fb10ae03d5a14494de8a9451388f8fd68d761f2121e01bdc2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c394d32d3a49fdc1a1967e20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "锁定目标",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeeb35e6e20c19b5a5d48ec650d1c348d516915064ed99d1c0949b6e6946beb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd678317a23ece6737b24727",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "直觉敏锐的摩耶重炮，\n每天都对训练项目追求新的刺激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "716b6fcf1c6889af919144263c3aec56b4c28150a6db4a152ecd430b87c0c320",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d243ce1786c8bc3fa6ac976",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在此时，\n对摩耶重炮相当中意的菱亚马逊，\n决定了要代替训练员照顾她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "054fb29df20325429c708fec2500c8c07fb84756840c2a64e637d24564d7b1cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    }
  ]
}
